	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1001_pass_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうちが　ある……
パスワードを　いれるみたいだ▼
パスワードを　いれますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>装置が　ある……
パスワードを　入力するみたいだ▼
パスワードを　入力しますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント
・Black2ver
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→入力画面へ
　いいえ→終了
・パスワード関連は
　hide_ship_passwordで</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>入力端末</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1001_switch_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>バリアが　かいじょ　された！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
