	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r1001_switch_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すべての　バリアが　かいじょ　され
さきに　すすめるように　なった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>すべての　バリアが　解除され
先に　進めるように　なった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント
・Black2ver
　White2ver共通
・すべてのバリアーが解除されたとき</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T02:26:13" />
		</CommentCell>
